# Keep the image build context minimal and deterministic: the SDK stage restores and builds
# from source only, so no local build output, IDE state, or VCS metadata may leak in.

## Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
publish/
**/*.binlog

## Test / coverage output
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/coverage*.*

## VCS and CI metadata (irrelevant to the image build)
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

## Container definitions themselves
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

## IDE / editor state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.DotSettings.user

## Docs and OS noise
README.md
LICENSE
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*~
